{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52550","headline":"恩义操 · 陈元光","name":"恩义操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天尊地卑分君臣，乾男坤女生男孙。\n怀恩抱义成人伦，入有双亲出有君。\n行义显亲亲以尊，隆恩敦君君以仁。\n君仁亲尊恩义纯，双全忠孝参乾坤。\n春秋乱贼纷然起，仲尼一笔扶人纪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}